<div class="space-y-1 text-xs text-slate-500"><p>Reporting limitations:</p><ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5"><li>AP/AR ageing shows full posted document values; payment allocations and receipts are not implemented.</li><li>Cash movement covers bank-linked GL accounts only; it is not a classified cash-flow statement.</li><li>Inventory shows movement quantities and recorded costs, not FIFO or weighted-average valuation.</li><li>Payroll summaries include approved runs only. Reports are management information, not audited statements.</li><li>Branch-scoped finance reports include only branch-attributed entries; legacy unassigned finance records remain available to company-wide users only.</li></ul></div>
